  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25890166",
      "title": "Installing & Using TypeScript",
      "sourceHash": "ee92acfca0121c8a65003bf9ef5e5c95b5a7a0a259cb35e093d8ab2b8e085756",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.34,
          "end": 5.03,
          "en": "So now that we know what TypeScript is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.03,
          "end": 8.99,
          "en": "that we can add types to our programs with it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.99,
          "end": 12.9,
          "en": "and how the syntax generally looks like,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.9,
          "end": 15.94,
          "en": "let's make sure we can all use TypeScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.94,
          "end": 18.72,
          "en": "And therefore if you search for TypeScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.72,
          "end": 21.62,
          "en": "you can visit typescriptlang.org",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.62,
          "end": 24.18,
          "en": "and that's the official TypeScript webpage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.18,
          "end": 26.82,
          "en": "where you can learn more about TypeScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.82,
          "end": 30.28,
          "en": "and where you can also learn how to install TypeScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.28,
          "end": 33.02,
          "en": "As a side note, if you want to learn way more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.02,
          "end": 35.79,
          "en": "about TypeScript, I also do have a complete",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.79,
          "end": 39.97,
          "en": "TypeScript course where I dive deeply into TypeScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.97,
          "end": 43.32,
          "en": "In this module, I'll just cover some basics.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.32,
          "end": 45.72,
          "en": "So if you want to learn more my full course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.72,
          "end": 47.77,
          "en": "might be interesting to you as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.77,
          "end": 50.453,
          "en": "or the official docs of course in addition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.38,
          "end": 53.26,
          "en": "So now to install it locally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.26,
          "end": 55.6,
          "en": "we can click here on install locally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.6,
          "end": 59.96,
          "en": "and now we basically need to run this command here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.96,
          "end": 64.13,
          "en": "Now for that, we need to make sure that Node.js is installed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.13,
          "end": 67.18,
          "en": "but we needed this for this course and for using React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.18,
          "end": 71.17,
          "en": "anyways and therefore that should already be installed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.17,
          "end": 72.83,
          "en": "So therefore we can now run this command",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.83,
          "end": 74.81,
          "en": "to install TypeScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.81,
          "end": 77.77,
          "en": "And running this command will install TypeScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.77,
          "end": 80.2,
          "en": "into a specific project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.2,
          "end": 83.41,
          "en": "If you wanna install it globally on your system,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.41,
          "end": 88.03,
          "en": "then you need to run npm install -g typescript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.03,
          "end": 91.6,
          "en": "But often installing it just into one specific project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.6,
          "end": 94.25,
          "en": "is enough so that you can then use TypeScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.25,
          "end": 98.03,
          "en": "in that project into which you install it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.03,
          "end": 100.49000000000001,
          "en": "And therefore that's what I'll do here now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.49000000000001,
          "end": 104.07,
          "en": "I will open my terminal, which is integrated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.07,
          "end": 108.583,
          "en": "here into this project and run npm install typescript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.58,
          "end": 113.78999999999999,
          "en": "And actually for this I'll first of all run npm init -y",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.78999999999999,
          "end": 116.50999999999999,
          "en": "to create a empty package.json file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.72,
          "end": 120.19,
          "en": "because we will need that to install dependencies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.19,
          "end": 123.94,
          "en": "and then I'll run npm install typescript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.94,
          "end": 127.17,
          "en": "And this will now install TypeScript into this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.17,
          "end": 131.54,
          "en": "Please note, this is still no React project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.54,
          "end": 134.78,
          "en": "This is still just a standard web project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.78,
          "end": 138.333,
          "en": "We'll move towards our React project a little bit later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.54,
          "end": 141.28300000000002,
          "en": "So now TypeScript is installed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.4,
          "end": 145.53,
          "en": "With that installed, we can now invoke",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.53,
          "end": 149.93,
          "en": "the TypeScript compiler and that is really important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 149.93,
          "end": 154.32,
          "en": "As you learned, TypeScript is a superset to JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.32,
          "end": 158.98,
          "en": "extending the JavaScript syntax with those extra types.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.98,
          "end": 163.25,
          "en": "Now the important thing to note is that TypeScript code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.25,
          "end": 165.93,
          "en": "does not run in the browser though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 165.93,
          "end": 168.91,
          "en": "So if you try to execute TypeScript in the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 168.91,
          "end": 170.09300000000002,
          "en": "it will fail.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 170.94,
          "end": 175.94,
          "en": "Therefore we need to compile TypeScript to JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 176.01,
          "end": 179.26,
          "en": "And during that compilation process,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 179.26,
          "end": 182.85,
          "en": "all our type annotations will be removed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 182.85,
          "end": 186.89,
          "en": "because JavaScript doesn't know those annotations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 186.89,
          "end": 189.65,
          "en": "But it's during this compilation step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 189.65,
          "end": 192.5,
          "en": "where we will be notified about errors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 192.5,
          "end": 195.773,
          "en": "In addition to the notification we get in the IDE already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 196.69,
          "end": 200.72,
          "en": "So it's this compilation step which then will warn us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 200.72,
          "end": 204,
          "en": "of potential code problems if we haven't spotted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 204,
          "end": 208.62,
          "en": "them in the IDE before and then it's that compiled code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 208.62,
          "end": 210.4,
          "en": "which will run in the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 210.4,
          "end": 212.94,
          "en": "Now to invoke this compiler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 212.94,
          "end": 217.94,
          "en": "we need to run this command here npx tsc.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 218.07,
          "end": 222.06,
          "en": "So now if I run npx tsc like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 222.06,
          "end": 224.66,
          "en": "you'll see that I get an error though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 224.66,
          "end": 227.59,
          "en": "I get this error because if I run this command",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 227.59,
          "end": 230.05,
          "en": "just like this, then it expects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 230.05,
          "end": 234.46,
          "en": "a TypeScript configuration file in that project folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 234.46,
          "end": 238.86,
          "en": "that tells TypeScript which files to compile.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 238.86,
          "end": 241.98,
          "en": "Now we'll add such a configuration file later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 241.98,
          "end": 245.96,
          "en": "for the moment we can run this command slightly modified.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 245.96,
          "end": 249.35,
          "en": "We can point at a file that should be compiled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 249.35,
          "end": 253.05,
          "en": "In this case, with typescript.ts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 253.05,
          "end": 256.96,
          "en": "So if I run npx tsc with typescript.ts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 256.96,
          "end": 259.57,
          "en": "then this file is getting compiled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 259.57,
          "end": 263.22,
          "en": "And hence now here I get one compilation error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 263.22,
          "end": 267.45,
          "en": "the same error my IDE warned me about before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 267.45,
          "end": 269.91,
          "en": "So if I haven't spotted it in the IDE,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 269.91,
          "end": 271.563,
          "en": "now I get an error here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 272.75,
          "end": 276.37,
          "en": "Now you will notice that a no-typescript.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 276.37,
          "end": 278.34000000000003,
          "en": "was created nonetheless.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 278.34000000000003,
          "end": 280.87,
          "en": "That simply happens because by default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 280.87,
          "end": 284.18,
          "en": "even if you get an error during the compilation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 284.18,
          "end": 286.05,
          "en": "it's still completes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 286.05,
          "end": 289.26,
          "en": "It just warns you because of that error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 289.26,
          "end": 292.15999999999997,
          "en": "but it still gives you a JavaScript file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 292.15999999999997,
          "end": 296.23,
          "en": "And this JavaScript file, sorry this one here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 296.23,
          "end": 299.34000000000003,
          "en": "is now based on our TypeScript file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 299.34000000000003,
          "end": 301.95,
          "en": "And you'll see it's almost the same code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 301.95,
          "end": 305.07,
          "en": "just without the types and actually it's changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 305.07,
          "end": 308.66,
          "en": "const to var because by default right now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 308.66,
          "end": 310.68,
          "en": "it's still also compiles to code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 310.68,
          "end": 314.31,
          "en": "such that it runs in older browsers as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 314.31,
          "end": 316.43,
          "en": "That is something which can be overwritten",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 316.43,
          "end": 318.55,
          "en": "with the TypeScript conflict file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 318.55,
          "end": 321,
          "en": "but we don't have such a conflict file yet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 321,
          "end": 324.13,
          "en": "and therefore we have this code change as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 324.13,
          "end": 326.69,
          "en": "But of course you see that other than that it's the same",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 326.69,
          "end": 329.72,
          "en": "code as we wrote in the TypeScript file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 329.72,
          "end": 332.7,
          "en": "Now of course we should get rid of that error though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 332.7,
          "end": 335.74,
          "en": "otherwise using TypeScript doesn't make any sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 335.74,
          "end": 338.248,
          "en": "and hence I'll convert my two numbers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 338.248,
          "end": 340.53,
          "en": "my two strings to numbers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 340.53,
          "end": 345.25,
          "en": "and if I save this now, the error is gone in the IDE.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 345.25,
          "end": 348.45,
          "en": "and if I now compile again, this also compiles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 348.45,
          "end": 350.89,
          "en": "without errors and we still have the same",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 350.89,
          "end": 353.4,
          "en": "JavaScript output as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 353.4,
          "end": 356.46,
          "en": "But now it's this JavaScript file which we could",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 356.46,
          "end": 359.11,
          "en": "import here and use here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 359.11,
          "end": 362.29,
          "en": "If I now save this and then reload this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 362.29,
          "end": 366.13,
          "en": "I get seven again but now if we continue working",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 366.13,
          "end": 369.65,
          "en": "in the TypeScript file and then compile it to run",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 369.65,
          "end": 374.25,
          "en": "in the browser, now we actually protect ourselves against",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 374.25,
          "end": 378.37,
          "en": "errors like we hadn't before, thanks to TypeScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 378.37,
          "end": 382.27,
          "en": "And now with that installed and now that we understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 382.27,
          "end": 385.94,
          "en": "what this compiler does and how it this generally works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 385.94,
          "end": 389.35,
          "en": "let's dive into some core features you need to know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 389.35,
          "end": 392.98,
          "en": "when working with TypeScript before we then thereafter see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 392.98,
          "end": 396.133,
          "en": "how we can use TypeScript with React.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}